			"notes": "BannerRenderer.renderPatterns hard-codes a cap of 16 layers, so banners\nwith more layers kept their data but stopped drawing. Mixin the cap and\nmake it configurable on the client.\n\n- Add BannerRendererMixin to raise the render cap\n- Add client config with render_mode (MAX/LIMIT/CUSTOM) and\n  custom_render_limit (6-64)\n- Add in-game config screen and lang entries"
		},
